# LeakSanitizer suppressions for xstore_tests. Use: ASAN_OPTIONS=... LSAN_OPTIONS="suppressions=tests/lsan.supp" ./tests/xstore_tests
# WalCompletion objects are checked out of XStore::completion_pool and returned to it, never freed (one allocation per
# concurrent SYNC writer for the life of the process, see EnqueueWalRecord); the pool is not drained at exit.
leak:XStore::EnqueueWalRecord
